{"id":"swap-then-beauty-combined","revision":0,"last_node_id":127,"last_link_id":52,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-920,-400],"size":[920,300],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"inswapper 分步换脸说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["## inswapper_128 细粒度分步（五官贴回）\n\n| 步骤 | 节点 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| ① | **对齐裁切** | 128 或 256（视模型） |\n| ② | **ONNX 换脸** | 在 swap_model 下拉切换模型 |\n| ②b | **五官蒙版预览** | 绿=五官、橙线=脸轮廓；灰度/脸区预览已接好 |\n| ③ | **五官贴回** | 只把换脸结果里的五官叠回原图（保留原脸型/肤色） |\n\n### 预览（已连线，无需改）\n- **预览 五官蒙版(绿)** ← `overlay_preview`\n- **预览 五官蒙版(灰)** ← `feature_mask_gray`\n- **预览 脸部区域** ← `face_region_mask`\n\n### ③ 节点可调\n- `include_*`：勾选要替换的五官\n- `mask_dilate_px` / `mask_blur`：消除边缘缝隙\n- `min_detection_confidence`：检测失败时回退小椭圆\n\n### 换模型\n| 模型 | 路径 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `inswapper_128.onnx` | `models/insightface/` | 默认 |\n| `hyperswap_1a_256.onnx` | `models/hyperswap/` | 256，有时更干净 |\n\n整脸贴回（椭圆蒙版）请用节点 `ReActor ③ 贴回蒙版 (core/cheek)` 替换 ③ 节点。\n\n---\n\n## 串联美颜\n换脸贴回结果 → **检测蒙版** → 瘦脸 → 大眼 → 祛斑 → 磨皮 → … → **保存**\n\n左侧预览③ 为换脸结果；右侧链末端为最终美颜输出。\n\n### 一套参数（推荐）\n②b 的 `feature_mask` → ③ `feature_mask`，`face_region_mask` → ③ `face_region_mask`。\n蒙版只在 **②b** 调；③ 保留 `warp_interpolation` / `mask_dilate_px` / `mask_blur`。"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":5,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[-120,40],"size":[260,280],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":3}],"outputs":[],"title":"预览① 对齐脸块","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":15,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[369.0908990024498,702.8099577091926],"size":[260,280],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":15}],"outputs":[],"title":"预览 五官蒙版(绿)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":17,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[369.0908990024498,1022.8099577091917],"size":[26